{
  "$schema": "https://lloom.dev/schemas/recipe.v1.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "profile": "https://lloom.dev/profiles/interchange/v1",
  "id": "linux-nvidia-dgx-spark-2x-glm53-atlas",
  "name": "2x DGX Spark GLM-5.3 Flash NVFP4 Atlas",
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "Source-built candidate lane for two directly connected Sparks running Atlas SparkGLM over the private fabric, serving GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 from a once-per-node overlay conversion with a 36864-token total context. Additive only: no default model, no aliases overwritten.",
  "description": "This recipe installs the source-built Atlas SparkGLM candidate at the immutable product revision recorded in backends/atlas-sparkglm/pins.json. LLooM owns orchestration, admission, worker-first startup, readiness, routing and telemetry. The Atlas engine is compiled from Enntity/sparkglm by that repository's research/atlas/install/build.sh; LLooM commits no engine source. Setup acquires the pinned model, builds the host-local image, performs the overlay conversion, and the serving path only ever starts the prepared image. Image IDs remain host-local and are verified from each node's build receipt plus OCI metadata. The candidate includes structured output and tool calls plus image/video input; live hardware and full serving qualification remain pending.",
  "license": {
    "id": "MIT",
    "name": "Recipe metadata, launcher and orchestration"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "lloom",
    "generatedBy": "manual-curated",
    "source": "Source-built Atlas SparkGLM candidate reconstructed from the measured 2026-09-24 launch profile and product revision e31900c3ba01809dc39e63ba55f43194f040f933. Engine source is Enntity/sparkglm at the revision recorded in backends/atlas-sparkglm/pins.json; each host's lloom/atlas-sparkglm:<SOURCE_REVISION> must match that host's build receipt, OCI revision label and arm64 image inspection. Model nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 revision 423acf37583782c51c142d145aef733d72943d93 requires a once-per-node overlay conversion gated on conversion.complete.json plus verification. The engine argument vector ships inside the image as /opt/atlas/profile.json, not in this recipe. The profile carries a 36864-token total context, four active text sequences, BF16 KV, FP32 SSM state and MTP2 with native fallback above 32K; disable-tool-grammar is deliberately not set so structured output and tools stay functional. Image/video support is implemented in the candidate; live hardware and full serving qualification remain pending."
  },
